  "details": "At the minute, the only documentation for launch args is found at https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/launch-options, however this documentation is lacking and does not describe the feature, behaviour, and usage in a user-friendly and digestible manner.\n\nMany users are redirected to the documentation for support, however without prerequisite knowledge this page does not contain sufficient information.\n\nPlease revise this page of the documentation to sufficiently cover each arguments usage, behaviour, and how it behaves with other args.",
